{
  "id": "concrete_columns",
  "title": "Concrete Columns",
  "description": "Estimate concrete volume required for concrete columns. Calculate the volume of concrete needed for round or square columns in cubic yards using column dimensions and height.",
  "type": "calculator",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Concrete Columns Calculator\n\nEstimate the concrete volume required for concrete columns using the formula:\n\n**v = 0.7854 × a² × h / 27**\n\nWhere:\n- **v** = required concrete (cubic yards)\n- **a** = column area (sq. ft.)\n- **h** = column height (ft)\n\n**Note:** 1 cubic yard = 27 cubic feet; 1 ft = 12 inches"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "column_type",
          "label": "Column Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Round Column",
              "value": "round"
            },
            {
              "label": "Square Column",
              "value": "square"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "round"
        },
        {
          "id": "column_diameter_round",
          "label": "Column Diameter (inches) - Round",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 12,
          "unit": "in"
        },
        {
          "id": "column_size_square",
          "label": "Column Size (inches) - Square",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 12,
          "unit": "in"
        },
        {
          "id": "column_height",
          "label": "Column Height",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "ft"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "column_area",
          "label": "Column Area",
          "formula": "inputs.column_type === 'round' ? 3.14159 * (inputs.column_diameter_round / 12) ** 2 / 4 : (inputs.column_size_square / 12) ** 2",
          "unit": "sq. ft.",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "concrete_volume",
          "label": "Concrete Volume Required",
          "formula": "0.7854 * (inputs.column_type === 'round' ? (inputs.column_diameter_round / 12) ** 2 : (inputs.column_size_square / 12) ** 2) * inputs.column_height / 27",
          "unit": "cy",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "datatable",
